        'list:List all files in the Blob store'
        'put:Upload a file to the Blob store'
        'put-image:Optimize an image and store the result'
        'get:Download a blob by URL or pathname'
        'del:Delete a file from the Blob store'
        'copy:Copy a file in the Blob store'
        'signed-token:Issue a short-lived signed token'
        'presign:Generate a presigned URL for Blob operations'
